<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud (Gallus gallus domesticus embryonic wing bud & high-density mesenchymal micromass (HH20 stylopod humerus -> HH24 zeugopod radius+ulna -> HH27 autopod digits II-IV))",
        "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud faithfully reproduces Gallus gallus domesticus embryonic wing bud & high-density mesenchymal micromass (HH20 stylopod humerus -> HH24 zeugopod radius+ulna -> HH27 autopod digits II-IV) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-1>,
