    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Gallus gallus domesticus embryonic wing bud & high-density mesenchymal micromass (HH20 stylopod humerus -> HH24 zeugopod radius+ulna -> HH27 autopod digits II-IV) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.5/100, audit 2026-10-19-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py> ;
