<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the Hentschel et al. (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B Eqs. (2.1)-(3.12) dispersion relation and haptotactic flux gain (`compute_hentschel_dispersion`, L102-177); numerically integrates the coupled 4-field `(c_a, c_i, F, R)` reaction-diffusion-haptotaxis PDE via DCT-II IMEX + conservative haptotactic flux differences in 1D (`integrate_hentschel_1d_multiscale_pde`, L183-310) and across the 2D proximodistal chick wing bud (`integrate_hentschel_2d_limb_bud_pde`, L313-409) as well as 2D periodic micromass cultures (`simulate_2d_micromass_morphospace`, L412-479); and backs all 3 laws with machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_014_tgfb_fibronectin_limb.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L628-688) extracts 8 reference-backed quantitative morphometrics covering HH20 stylopod cell condensation count (1.0 vs 1.0 ref), HH24 zeugopod cell condensation count (2.0 vs 2.0 ref), HH27 chick wing autopod cell condensation count (3.0 vs 3.0 ref), HH28 hindlimb / high-TGFb condensation count (4.0 vs 4.0 ref), 2D composite chick wing bud total condensations (6.0 vs 6.0 ref across 1+2+3 compartments), fibronectin-cell colocalization correlation (Pearson r = 0.9997 vs 0.98 ref), anti-fibronectin (`chi_F=0`) and equal-diffusion (`Da=Di`) negative control cell amplitude (`std(R) = 9.0e-5` vs 0.0 ref), and segmented Gallus gallus wing specimen zeugopod-to-autopod spacing ratio (1.4074 vs 1.4074 ref)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-2d-composite-chick-wing-bud-total-haptotactic-skeletal-elements-1-2-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-anti-fibronectin-no-haptotaxis-chi-f-0-and-equal-diffusion-da-di-negative-control-cell-amplitude>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-fibronectin-f-x-vs-mesenchymal-cell-density-r-x-haptotactic-colocalization-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-hh20-stylopod-haptotactic-cell-condensation-count-m-fa-3-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-hh24-zeugopod-haptotactic-cell-condensation-count-m-fa-6-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-hh27-chick-wing-autopod-haptotactic-cell-condensation-count-m-fa-11-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-hh28-hindlimb-high-tgf-beta-autopod-condensation-count-m-fa-18-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-segmented-gallus-gallus-wing-specimen-zeugopod-to-autopod-spacing-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — MorphoEval overall 92.5/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) post-remediation evaluation of `2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py` (overall weighted score: 92.6 / 100, up +44.4 points from 48.2 / 100 in Pass 1). The remediated script numerically integrates the coupled 4-field Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) *Proc. R. Soc. B* / Kiskowski et al. (2004) *Dev. Biol.* multiscale reaction-diffusion-haptotaxis PDE system (`c_a` TGF-beta, `c_i` FGF-dependent inhibitor, `F` extracellular matrix fibronectin, and `R` haptotactic mesenchymal cell density) with zero-flux Neumann ectodermal boundaries across both 1D progress-zone cross-sections and the 2D composite proximodistal chick wing bud; reproduces all 4 AER-FGF zonation stages (`m = 1` stylopod humerus -> `m = 2` zeugopod radius+ulna -> `m = 3` chick wing digits II-IV -> `m = 4` hindlimb/high-TGFb digits I-IV) with strong F-R colocalization (`r = 0.9997` in autopod); simulates the 2D high-density micromass nodular-spot (`19.8%` area fraction) vs exogenous TGF-beta2 labyrinthine-stripe (`44.8%` area fraction, Miura & Shiota 2000) vs anti-fibronectin no-haptotaxis (`chi_F = 0`, `0.0%` area fraction) morphospace; verifies dual negative controls (`Da = Di = 0.5` and `chi_F = 0.0`); segments the stylopod (1 bone), zeugopod (2 bones), and autopod (3 digits) on a SHA-256-locked Gallus gallus wing specimen; and backs all 3 governing laws with machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_014_tgfb_fibronectin_limb.lean`. Overall 92.5/100 (faithfulness 92.4, reproducibility 92.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 94, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/tgfb_fibronectin_limb_comparison.png: rendered output of 2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py at 8871db0, image/png, 719240 B, 2230×1349 px, artifact_sha256 eea82e7f7885e55ae30c9fe24dc1c7543fe1efe2cba337aec39970ed1c704b86 (sha256 eea82e7f7885e55ae30c9fe24dc1c7543fe1efe2cba337aec39970ed1c704b86), spec_fingerprint a2738dce4265d3cbf1985dad5976f0edb36bd4a8ed6349bde78d12e6cc7cd510. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a2738dce4265d3cbf1985dad5976f0edb36bd4a8ed6349bde78d12e6cc7cd510; artifact_sha256: eea82e7f7885e55ae30c9fe24dc1c7543fe1efe2cba337aec39970ed1c704b86; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/tgfb_fibronectin_limb/chick_limb_chondrogenesis_specimen.jpg=771e26f9fe8c813d..., datasets/tgfb_fibronectin_limb/scout_manifest.json=c810bd77e66557c8..., datasets/tgfb_fibronectin_limb/tgfb_fibronectin_limb_reference.json=33d554e44b712e2b...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the continuum 4-field reaction-diffusion-haptotaxis solver to a cellular Potts (Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg) discrete cell-sorting lattice as in Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. 271:372-387." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.25e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — Parameter expressivity: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Simulates all 4 proximodistal AER-FGF zonation regimes (`run_fgf_zonation_sweep`, L485-516) across `fa in {3, 6, 11, 18}` reproducing `[1, 2, 3, 4]` cell condensations; simulates the 2D micromass morphospace across WT nodular spots (`19.8%` area fraction), exogenous TGF-beta2 labyrinthine stripes (`44.8%` area fraction), and anti-fibronectin `chi_F = 0` (`0.0%` area fraction); sweeps haptotactic sensitivity `chi_F in [0.0, 1.15]` in Panel G; executes dual negative controls (`run_negative_controls`, L519-535); and exposes full CLI flags (`--fa`, `--L-AP-um`, `--Da`, `--Di`, `--chi-F`, `--k-F`, `--steps`, `--seed`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
