    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — Reproducibility package: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Deterministic RNG (`seed=2004`), 8-check `--self-test` suite (L692-716) verifying SHA-256 locks, dispersion monotonicity and haptotactic flux gain, exact 4-stage PDE cell condensation counts `[1, 2, 3, 4]` and F-R colocalization (`r > 0.90`), 2D proximodistal wing bud `[1, 2, 3]` condensations, dual negative controls (`Da=Di` and `chi_F=0`), 2D micromass nodular vs stripe area fractions, Gallus gallus wing bone segmentation (`[1, 2, 3]` bones), and bitwise two-run determinism, plus self-contained 8-panel PNG and 4-frame GIF." ;
